# The browser renderer that travels inside the app is build output and never
# source. Its source is browser/ at the top of the repository:
#
#   dev/bundle-browser.sh
#
# tauri.conf.json lists browser/ under bundle.resources. The mixer looks for
# it there (Contents/Resources/browser/godwinmix-browser.app on macOS,
# browser/ beside the executable on Windows, /usr/lib/GodwinMix/browser in a
# .deb); see crates/godwinmix-core/src/setup/web.rs.
*
!.gitignore
